                  "fill": "$io-parchment",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Each image asks one question, usually how it should be rated. Judges answer independently, and you never see anyone else's answer. When enough judges agree the image is rated that way; a split goes up to higher ranks, and finally to a moderator.",
